# Analytics & Monetization Walkthrough

We have successfully modernized the SkillPilot platform with a robust analytics engine and flexible monetization models.

## 1. Admin Analytics Dashboard
The new **Analytics** dashboard provides real-time insights into platform performance.
- **KPI Metrics**: Real-time tracking of Revenue, Enrollments, Active Students, and Completion Rates.
- **Query Caching**: Statistics are cached for 60 minutes to ensure peak performance for administrators.
- **Visual Insights**: Interactive charts powered by Recharts, including Revenue Trends and Top-Performing Courses.

![Analytics Dashboard](file:///C:/Users/mpo491/.gemini/antigravity/brain/c3fed0f2-a13b-45d5-93ac-4bba2cc75e43/.system_generated/recordings/verify_analytics_and_bundles_v2_1776756278368.webp)

## 2. Course Bundles (Unlock Logic)
We implemented a "Deferred Enrollment" system for course packages.
- **Bundle Management**: Admins can group courses into bundles and set package prices.
- **Unlock Right**: Purchasing a bundle doesn't clutter the student's dashboard. Instead, it grants them the **right to unlock** individual courses at their convenience.
- **Backend Security**: Enforced via `Bundles` module and ownership verification logic.

## 3. Tiered Memberships
A new subscription engine has been added to drive recurring revenue.
- **Custom Tiers**: Support for multiple membership levels (e.g., Bronze, Silver, Gold).
- **CourseAccessService**: A centralized service that governs course availability based on enrollment, bundles, or membership levels.
- **Pricing UI**: A premium, student-facing membership page detailing tier benefits and pricing.

---

### Key Technical Achievements
> [!NOTE]
> **Performance**: All dashboard metrics use Laravel's Caching layer to prevent heavy DB load.
> **Security**: The `CourseAccessService` ensures that monetization guards are consistent across the API.
> **Scalability**: New features are isolated in standalone modules (`Modules/Bundles`, `Modules/Memberships`) for easy maintenance.

### Verification Results
Active feature tests have been implemented to ensure long-term stability:
- **`AdminAnalyticsTest`**: Enforces admin-only access to platform KPIs and revenue data.
- **`BundleTest`**: Validates student purchase tracking and the deferred 'Unlock' enrollment logic.
- **`MembershipTest`**: Verifies tiered access gating (Level 1, 2, 3) and subscription state management.

- [x] Admin Analytics rendering and auth verified.
- [x] Bundle management page and 'Unlock' logic verified.
- [x] Membership pricing page and Tiered Access Service verified.
- [x] **100% Pass Rate** on all core monetization tests.
